{
  "id": 493013147,
  "iid": 25268,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Bluetooth HCI: Add core spec 6.1 - 6.3 support",
  "description": "Dissection added for HCI commands/events:\n\n```\nRead Local Supported Commands [v2]\nLE Set Resolvable Private Address Timeout [v2]\nLE Enable UTP OTA Mode\nLE UTP Send\nLE Connection Rate Request\nLE Set Default Rate Parameters\nLE Read Minimum Supported Connection Interval\nLE Set Event Mask [v2]\nLE CS Read Local Supported Capabilities [v2]\nLE CS Write Cached Remote Supported Capabilities [v2]\nLE CS Set Security Requirements\nLE CS Set Default Security Requirements\nLE UTP Receive\nLE Connection Rate Change\nLE CS Read Remote Supported Capabilities Complete [v2]\n(added [v1] to existing names for above [v2] commands/events)\n\nUpdated:\nLE CS Create Config command\nLE CS Config Complete event\n\nVersion, feature bits and event mask fields updated.\nLE CS step result decoding improved.\nCorrected various command parameters from big endian.\n```\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
